{% extends "layout.html.jinja" %}

{% block extra_head %}
{% include "partials/_jsonld_breadcrumb.html.jinja" %}
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="text-[10px] text-outline uppercase font-mono mb-6">
  <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary-container">HOME</a>
  <span class="text-outline-variant"> / </span>
  <span class="text-primary-container">BREVETTI</span>
</nav>

<section class="mb-10 max-w-3xl">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase">&gt; BREVETTI GOOGLE</h1>
    <div class="flex-grow h-px bg-outline-variant border-dashed border-t"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
    I brevetti di Google che possono riguardare la SEO, letti dal testo originale. Ogni scheda separa tre livelli: cosa coprono le rivendicazioni, cosa potrebbe significare per la SEO e cosa il brevetto non dimostra.
  </p>
  <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Un brevetto descrive cosa un'azienda vuole proteggere, non cosa gira oggi in Google Search. Le continuation fanno parte della stessa famiglia del brevetto originale: le indichiamo come tali, non come prove indipendenti.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[10px] text-outline uppercase font-mono">
    {{ rows | length }} BREVETTI // NUOVE PUBBLICAZIONI CERCATE OGNI GIORNO
  </p>
</section>

{% if themes %}
<section class="mb-8 max-w-5xl">
  <h2 class="text-xs text-outline uppercase font-mono mb-3 tracking-widest">&gt; FILONI</h2>
  <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
    {% for t in themes %}
    <li class="text-xs font-mono border border-outline-variant px-2 py-1 text-on-surface-variant">{{ t.label }} <span class="text-outline">({{ t.count }})</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="max-w-5xl">
  <div class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-outline-variant border-t border-b border-outline-variant">
    {% for r in rows %}
    <a href="/brevetti/{{ r.slug }}/" class="py-4 grid grid-cols-[3.5rem_1fr] sm:grid-cols-[3.5rem_11rem_1fr_auto] gap-x-4 gap-y-1 items-baseline group hover:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-colors">
      <span class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-primary-container">{{ r.year }}</span>
      <span class="text-sm font-mono text-white">{{ r.number }}{% if not r.is_grant %} <span class="text-[10px] text-outline">DOMANDA</span>{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="col-start-2 sm:col-start-auto">
        <span class="block text-base text-white group-hover:text-primary-container">{{ r.title_it }}</span>
        <span class="block text-[10px] text-outline font-mono uppercase mt-1">{{ r.theme_label }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="col-start-2 sm:col-start-auto text-xs text-[#f5a623] font-mono" title="Rilevanza SEO">{{ r.stars }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
